# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and the working tree, so a
# checkout on Windows doesn't show every data/eval file as modified with a
# line-ending-only diff (see docs/status_report.md §1).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Upstream source files are kept byte-for-byte as fetched (three of the
# Anandajoti interlinear .htm files are CRLF upstream); never convert them.
sources/** -text

# Binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ico  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.npy  binary
*.pkl  binary
